                    We are looking for a Full-Stack Developer to lead the technical evolution of a subscription-based B2C application that is already in production, generating revenue, and serving an active user base.



The developer will maintain and improve an application built with Next.js, React, TypeScript, Supabase, and Vercel.



Main responsibilities:



• Take ownership of and understand an existing codebase;

• Fix and improve payment integrations with Whop and Stripe;

• Work with webhooks, idempotency, and prevention of duplicate records;

• Improve automations, queues, and data tracking;

• Support the organization and reconciliation of financial records and ledger data;

• Recommend the best technical approach for converting the web application into a mobile app;

• Manage the publishing process for the Apple App Store and Google Play;

• Document all changes and deliverables alongside the code.



Main requirements:



• Experience with Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Supabase/Postgres;

• Experience maintaining production systems and taking over existing codebases;

• Knowledge of payment integrations and webhooks;

• Experience publishing applications to the Apple App Store and Google Play;

• Strong organization, autonomy, and communication skills.



Nice to have:



• Experience with Whop and Stripe;

• Knowledge of financial ledgers and payment reconciliation;

• Experience with Sentry, PostHog, Resend, and Vercel;

• Experience with subscription-based B2C applications.



The engagement model, availability, and compensation will be discussed during the interview process.



To apply, please send a brief introduction, your portfolio, examples of similar projects, availability, and expected compensation.
